<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Royal Dutch.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Royal Dutch.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Warburg is placing 7.5 million American-style call warrants, on Royal Dutch Petroleum Company, for the issuer Swiss bank corp.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    120 NLG		   PREMIUM	19.41 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     0.83 CHF		  GEARING	9.79 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	28.DEC.98		 PAYDATE	22.JUL.97</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    10			  SPOT REF     109.90 NLG</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE   SBCEDNL3</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
